---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="home">
		<h1>Servus, I&rsquo;m <span class="expand-trigger" data-for="exp-name">Sonja<sup>1</sup></span>.</h1>
		<p class="tagline">
			<span class="expand-trigger" data-for="exp-1">Modeling<sup>2</sup></span>, <span class="expand-trigger" data-for="exp-2">juggling<sup>3</sup></span>, and <span class="expand-trigger" data-for="exp-3">ex-footballing<sup>4</sup></span>.
		</p>
		<nav class="link-boxes" aria-label="Site sections">
			<button class="link-box" id="travel-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="travel-map-panel">Travel</button>
		</nav>
		<section class="travel-map-panel" id="travel-map-panel" hidden>
			<div class="travel-map-card">
				<div class="travel-map-header">
					<p class="travel-map-label">UNESCO World Heritage</p>
					<p class="travel-map-count"><span id="heritage-count">0</span> visited</p>
				</div>
				<div class="world-map-frame">
					<svg class="world-map" viewBox="0 0 1000 520" role="img" aria-labelledby="world-map-title world-map-desc">
						<title id="world-map-title">Visited UNESCO World Heritage sites</title>
						<desc id="world-map-desc">A world map with markers for visited UNESCO World Heritage sites.</desc>
						<rect class="map-ocean" width="1000" height="520" rx="16"></rect>
						<g class="map-grid" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M166 28V492"></path>
							<path d="M333 28V492"></path>
							<path d="M500 28V492"></path>
							<path d="M667 28V492"></path>
							<path d="M834 28V492"></path>
							<path d="M42 130H958"></path>
							<path d="M42 260H958"></path>
							<path d="M42 390H958"></path>
						</g>
						<g class="map-land" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M112 154C148 99 240 85 313 122C336 143 323 172 348 198C318 233 267 219 231 257C204 292 152 277 129 247C99 229 91 184 112 154Z"></path>
							<path d="M321 49C363 26 419 45 439 78C407 107 352 106 319 82C311 69 312 58 321 49Z"></path>
							<path d="M291 286C330 305 351 345 340 387C332 429 310 471 284 493C251 462 248 410 263 371C276 340 251 310 291 286Z"></path>
							<path d="M468 148C506 125 556 129 586 156C560 186 511 186 471 166C462 161 461 154 468 148Z"></path>
							<path d="M519 211C586 216 631 267 620 332C609 400 568 456 535 431C501 390 485 311 500 251C505 231 510 218 519 211Z"></path>
							<path d="M586 145C690 105 825 135 902 205C852 241 781 221 745 261C706 311 651 291 616 246C586 207 551 181 586 145Z"></path>
							<path d="M760 365C811 345 870 361 890 400C849 431 785 425 752 395C743 383 746 372 760 365Z"></path>
							<path d="M84 481C225 464 373 471 501 482C638 468 786 467 918 484C846 510 189 511 84 481Z"></path>
							<ellipse cx="458" cy="142" rx="9" ry="14"></ellipse>
							<ellipse cx="875" cy="242" rx="9" ry="20"></ellipse>
							<ellipse cx="908" cy="436" rx="20" ry="9"></ellipse>
						</g>
						<g id="heritage-markers" class="heritage-markers"></g>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<ol class="heritage-list" id="heritage-list"></ol>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Sticky-note style overlays -->
		<div id="exp-name" class="sticky-note" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">1</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				Sonja Ning Tang. My Chinese name is 唐宁 (Táng Níng).
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="exp-1" class="sticky-note" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">2</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				I model data, especially human genetic, metabolomic, proteomic, phenomic, and epidemiologic data. But I'm interested in data of all kinds, and lately I've also been learning more about financial data.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="exp-2" class="sticky-note" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">3</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				I juggle AI agents to build fun things, and occasionally actual juggling balls too.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="exp-3" class="sticky-note" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">4</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				Putting "ex-" anything in a tagline does feel a bit odd. But I once wanted to become a professional <span class="expand-trigger nested" data-for="exp-3-1">footballer<sup>1</sup></span>, until I tore my <span class="expand-trigger nested" data-for="exp-3-2">ACL<sup>2</sup></span> — not once, but twice. That changed the trajectory of my life, and is part of what drew me towards health and life sciences.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="exp-3-1" class="sticky-note sticky-note--nested" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">1</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				My favourite players are Lionel Messi and Tobin Heath. My favourite match is the 2011 Women's World Cup final between Japan and the US.
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="exp-3-2" class="sticky-note sticky-note--nested" hidden>
			<button type="button" class="sticky-note-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
			<span class="sticky-note-label">2</span>
			<div class="sticky-note-body">
				The anterior cruciate ligament (ACL), is one of the most commonly injured knee ligaments. ACL injuries are notably more common in girl's/women's sport than in boy's/men's, and the reasons are still not fully understood. It is an area that deserves much more research!!!
			</div>
		</div>

		<div id="sticky-backdrop" class="sticky-backdrop" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div>
	</main>
</Layout>

<script>
	// @ts-nocheck
	const visitedHeritageSites = [
		// Add visited UNESCO sites here:
		// { name: 'Site name', country: 'Country', lat: 0, lng: 0, visited: '2026' },
	];

	const mapWidth = 1000;
	const mapHeight = 520;

	function projectToMap(lat, lng) {
		return {
			x: ((lng + 180) / 360) * mapWidth,
			y: ((90 - lat) / 180) * mapHeight,
		};
	}

	function createSvgElement(name, attributes = {}) {
		const el = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', name);
		Object.entries(attributes).forEach(([key, value]) => el.setAttribute(key, value));
		return el;
	}

	function formatSiteLabel(site) {
		const place = site.country ? `${site.name}, ${site.country}` : site.name;
		return site.visited ? `${place} (${site.visited})` : place;
	}

	function renderVisitedSites() {
		const markerLayer = document.getElementById('heritage-markers');
		const siteList = document.getElementById('heritage-list');
		const count = document.getElementById('heritage-count');
		if (!markerLayer || !siteList || !count) return;

		markerLayer.replaceChildren();
		siteList.replaceChildren();
		count.textContent = visitedHeritageSites.length;
		siteList.hidden = visitedHeritageSites.length === 0;

		visitedHeritageSites.forEach((site, index) => {
			const { x, y } = projectToMap(site.lat, site.lng);
			const marker = createSvgElement('g', {
				class: 'heritage-marker',
				role: 'listitem',
				tabindex: '0',
				'aria-label': formatSiteLabel(site),
				transform: `translate(${x.toFixed(2)} ${y.toFixed(2)})`,
			});
			const title = createSvgElement('title');
			title.textContent = formatSiteLabel(site);
			const halo = createSvgElement('circle', { class: 'heritage-marker-halo', r: '10' });
			const dot = createSvgElement('circle', { class: 'heritage-marker-dot', r: '5' });
			marker.append(title, halo, dot);
			markerLayer.append(marker);

			const item = document.createElement('li');
			item.textContent = formatSiteLabel(site);
			siteList.append(item);
		});
	}

	function toggleTravelMap() {
		const toggle = document.getElementById('travel-toggle');
		const panel = document.getElementById('travel-map-panel');
		if (!toggle || !panel) return;

		const shouldOpen = panel.hidden;
		panel.hidden = !shouldOpen;
		toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(shouldOpen));
		if (shouldOpen) renderVisitedSites();
	}

	document.getElementById('travel-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', toggleTravelMap);

	function positionNote(note, trigger) {
		const margin = 16;
		const gap = 12;
		const triggerRect = trigger.getBoundingClientRect();

		note.style.visibility = 'hidden';
		note.hidden = false;

		const noteRect = note.getBoundingClientRect();
		const availableAbove = triggerRect.top - margin;
		const availableBelow = window.innerHeight - triggerRect.bottom - margin;
		const placeAbove = availableAbove >= noteRect.height || availableAbove > availableBelow;
		const top = placeAbove
			? Math.max(margin, triggerRect.top - noteRect.height - gap)
			: Math.min(window.innerHeight - noteRect.height - margin, triggerRect.bottom + gap);
		const centeredLeft = triggerRect.left + (triggerRect.width / 2) - (noteRect.width / 2);
		const left = Math.min(
			Math.max(margin, centeredLeft),
			window.innerWidth - noteRect.width - margin
		);

		note.style.top = `${Math.max(margin, top)}px`;
		note.style.left = `${left}px`;
		note.style.visibility = '';
	}

	function openNote(id, trigger) {
		const note = document.getElementById(id);
		const backdrop = document.getElementById('sticky-backdrop');
		if (note && backdrop) {
			positionNote(note, trigger);
			backdrop.hidden = false;
		}
	}

	function closeNote(id) {
		const note = document.getElementById(id);
		if (note) note.hidden = true;
		updateBackdrop();
	}

	function closeAllNotes() {
		document.querySelectorAll('.sticky-note').forEach((el) => { el.setAttribute('hidden', ''); });
		const backdrop = document.getElementById('sticky-backdrop');
		if (backdrop) backdrop.hidden = true;
	}

	function closeNestedNotes() {
		document.querySelectorAll('.sticky-note--nested').forEach((el) => { el.setAttribute('hidden', ''); });
	}

	function updateBackdrop() {
		const backdrop = document.getElementById('sticky-backdrop');
		if (backdrop) backdrop.hidden = !document.querySelector('.sticky-note:not([hidden])');
	}

	document.querySelectorAll('.expand-trigger').forEach((el) => {
		el.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
			e.preventDefault();
			e.stopPropagation();
			const id = el.getAttribute('data-for');
			if (!id) return;
			const box = document.getElementById(id);
			if (!box) return;
			const isNestedTrigger = el.classList.contains('nested');
			if (box.hidden) {
				if (isNestedTrigger) {
					closeNestedNotes();
				} else {
					closeAllNotes();
				}
				openNote(id, el);
			} else {
				if (isNestedTrigger) {
					closeNote(id);
				} else {
					closeAllNotes();
				}
			}
		});
	});

	document.querySelectorAll('.sticky-note-close').forEach((btn) => {
		btn.addEventListener('click', () => closeAllNotes());
	});

	document.getElementById('sticky-backdrop')?.addEventListener('click', () => closeAllNotes());
</script>

<style>
	.home {
		padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.link-boxes {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}

	.link-box {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-width: 6rem;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
		font: inherit;
		border: 1px solid rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.22);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
		color: #1c1917;
		cursor: pointer;
		text-decoration: none;
		box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) inset;
		transition:
			background-color 160ms ease,
			border-color 160ms ease,
			color 160ms ease;
	}

	.link-box:hover,
	.link-box:focus-visible,
	.link-box[aria-expanded="true"] {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
		border-color: #228b22;
		color: #228b22;
	}

	.travel-map-panel {
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		width: min(100%, 46rem);
	}

	.travel-map-card {
		padding: 0.85rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.22);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
		box-shadow:
			0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) inset,
			0 0.75rem 1.5rem rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.08);
	}

	.travel-map-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
	}

	.travel-map-label,
	.travel-map-count {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.travel-map-label {
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.travel-map-count {
		color: rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.72);
	}

	.world-map-frame {
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.18);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: #eef7f1;
	}

	.world-map {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 1000 / 520;
	}

	.map-ocean {
		fill: #eef7f1;
	}

	.map-grid path {
		fill: none;
		stroke: rgba(34, 139, 34, 0.14);
		stroke-width: 1;
	}

	.map-land path,
	.map-land ellipse {
		fill: #d8d2b8;
		stroke: rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.2);
		stroke-width: 1.5;
	}

	.heritage-marker {
		color: #228b22;
		outline: none;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.heritage-marker-halo {
		fill: currentColor;
		opacity: 0.2;
	}

	.heritage-marker-dot {
		fill: currentColor;
		stroke: #fffdf2;
		stroke-width: 2;
	}

	.heritage-marker:hover,
	.heritage-marker:focus-visible {
		color: #176117;
	}

	.heritage-list {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.25rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
	}

	.expand-trigger {
		cursor: pointer;
		color: inherit;
		transition: color 160ms ease;
	}

	.expand-trigger sup {
		color: #228b22;
		font-size: 0.7em;
	}

	.expand-trigger:hover,
	.expand-trigger:focus-visible,
	.expand-trigger:hover sup,
	.expand-trigger:focus-visible sup {
		color: #228b22;
	}

	/* Backdrop: dim page when a note is open */
	.sticky-backdrop {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
		z-index: 10;
	}

	/* Sticky note: post-it style overlay */
	.sticky-note {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
		z-index: 20;
		width: min(90vw, 22rem);
		max-height: 80vh;
		overflow: auto;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem 1.5rem;
		background: #fef08a;
		box-shadow:
			2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
			4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04),
			8px 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
		border-radius: 2px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
	}

	.sticky-note--nested {
		background: #fef9c3;
		transform: rotate(0.8deg);
		box-shadow:
			2px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
			6px 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
	}

	.sticky-note-close {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0.5rem;
		right: 0.5rem;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1;
		color: #78716c;
		background: none;
		border: none;
		cursor: pointer;
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	.sticky-note-close:hover {
		color: #1c1917;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
	}

	.sticky-note-label {
		display: inline-block;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #228b22;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.sticky-note-body {
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #1c1917;
		padding-right: 0.5rem;
	}

	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger {
		cursor: pointer;
		color: inherit;
	}

	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger sup {
		color: #228b22;
		font-size: 0.7em;
	}

	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger:hover,
	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger:focus-visible,
	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger:hover sup,
	.sticky-note-body .expand-trigger:focus-visible sup {
		color: #228b22;
	}
</style>
